    {
      "key": "best_quote",
      "value": {
        "type": "Text",
        "data": "My most significant issues were 1) the villa's plot area was very low. It was hardly a 1200 sqft plot for a 5 bhk! They are constructing 3 floors. 2) There was absolutely no gap between the adjacent 2 units, so there was almost nil privacy. They packed 250+ rowhouses in 15 acres, one of the highest I have seen. 3) they are rowhouses and not villas. So you get UDS not ownership of the land."
      },
      "confidence": 0.5,
